00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:53.100
Ronja went to Hell's Gap and met a boy she'd never seen before.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.430
The first boy she ever saw in her life...

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:07.190
Enemy in the Castle

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:07.190
Enemy in the Castle

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:25.880
Hey, robber girl! I know who you are!

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:30.010
I saw you running in the woods once.

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.430
Then, who are you?

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.680
And how in the world did you get here?

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.160
I'm Birk Borkason.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:01.160
We moved in last night.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.080
We? Who's we?

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:15.050
Borka, Undis, and me. And our twelve robbers.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.010
Huh?

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:31.030
Do you mean that the whole of the north fort is now full of dirty devils?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.910
That's not quite right.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:40.700
There are only decent Borka robbers here.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:46.580
But over there where you live it's stuffed full of dirty devils — that's what they always say.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.380
What did you say?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.510
In any case, this isn't the north fort any more.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:57.190
Since last night, it's called Borka's Keep.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.390
You just remember that!

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.890
You'll be in huge trouble!

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:10.400
You wait until Mattis hears about this, then you'll see all those Borka robbers scatter with one blow.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.030
That's what you think.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.680
If Mattis somehow found out about this...

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:53.030
What's the matter with you? Don't you feel well?

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:01.030
If you come here, I'll give you such a punch, your nose will fall off.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.610
Follow that, if you can!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:31.050
You're not so bad.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:47.080
You were going to punch me in the face...

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:49.210
Why didn't you?

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:51.000
I'm coming!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.550
So I see!

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.750
This day should never have happened!

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.800
That brat should have never existed!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:58.820
We never should have jumped!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:25.740
Hold still!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:27.720
Well...

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:34.780
There's not much else... I can do here.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.900
Grab on to that.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.210
Get it around your waist if you can.

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:11.100
Once you've done that, you can start climbing when I tell you to.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.060
But not before!

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.900
Start now!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:54.680
I can't do this!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.020
Soon I'm going to...

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:01.270
split in half...

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:06.240
just like the fort!

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:21.590
I see, taking a nap are you?

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.550
Yeah, I'm just taking a nap.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:30.050
Done enough jumping now?

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.390
I'll have to jump once more.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.560
To get to home.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:42.570
Before you do that, take off my leather rope.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:50.060
I don't want to stay tied to you any longer than I have to.

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:53.030
No, of course not.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:56.050
But after this,

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:00.120
perhaps I'm tied to you all the same.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.590
Even without a rope.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.840
Me and you tied... Not on your life!

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:10.760
You and your Borka's Keep, should all be shoved into the pits of hell!

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:17.710
Don't you do that again, take my advice.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:22.690
But it was nice of you to save my life.

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.860
And I thank you for it.

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:33.930
I told you, go burn in the pits of hell!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:34.640
Hmph!

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.520
Hey!

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.210
Robber's daughter!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.210
I'll be seeing you!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:55.060
I hope you fall in again, dirty devil!

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:03.600
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:03.600
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:37.710
This is the first time I've ever even thought of scolding you.

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.480
Why?

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:48.230
A bit of lying and pretending can be fun sometimes,

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:55.950
but, Ronja, you've got to stop this make-believe!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:04.290
Borka robbers in the north fort, indeed! What rubbish!

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:09.550
Even though I know it's a lie,

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:13.170
it makes my blood boil and...

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.720
It's not a lie.

00:12:19.390 --> 00:12:23.980
In the evening, he went with Borka and Undis—

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.480
You're lying!

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:29.970
I've never heard a single word about Borka having a boy!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.490
Isn't that right, guys?

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.020
Well, Borka....

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.630
they do say he has a boy, all the same.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:03.520
It seems that he was born on the same night as Ronja.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:12.410
They say, surprised by the lightning, Undis gave birth to him in sheer terror.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:23.370
And no one told me about this?!

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.870
What a waste!

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:33.630
What other deviltry is there that I should know?

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:47.290
And now Borka's snake-spawn is taking his ease on the roof of this fort?

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:51.480
And you, Ronja, have talked to him?

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.770
He talked to me first.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:20.960
That snake-spawn claimed that his father has moved into the north fort with the whole of his robber scum,

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.140
is that what you're telling me?

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.060
Yes.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:29.390
And now it's called Borka's Keep,

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.630
just remember that.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.620
Watch out!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:52.880
Run away!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.430
Here you are.

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:11.230
But...

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:15.030
You'll have to clean up after yourself.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.730
Remember that!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:09.120
Safe as the fox at it's lair and the eagle in it's nest, that's what I said!

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:12.130
Uh-huh.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:15.310
Yet...

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.090
Now that...

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:28.800
Daddy.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.110
Now that's enough.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:55.500
If you've got lice in your coat,
 roaring won't get rid of them.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.550
So get up,

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:10.510
and do something about it.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.520
It's probably only a bit more tender.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.050
Daddy,

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.570
don't be sad.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:10.490
All you have to do is kick them out of the fort.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:15.550
And that may be hard.

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:41.940
What should we do to chase Borka out of the fort?

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:46.940
Or rather, how did those stray hounds even get in?

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:52.700
To get into the fort, they'd have to
 pass through Wolf's Neck.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:19:01.210
Wolf's Neck

00:18:50.240 --> 00:19:01.210
South Fort

00:18:50.240 --> 00:19:01.210
North Fort

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:57.320
We've got watchmen on Wolf's Neck day and night.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.290
It's impossible.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:05.250
Besides, it's not like anyone saw them.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.590
I know!

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:15.470
They came from the sky!

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.220
Idiot! That's absolutely impossible!

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:19.980
Wolf's Neck

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:19.980
South Fort

